WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.606
A reshape should be validated For additive measures
such as revenue

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:11.591
calculate the total from the source Then calculate
the total represented

00:00:11.618 --> 00:00:17.142
by the pivot cells The totals should agree when the
same observations are

00:00:17.169 --> 00:00:22.491
included This simple check catches many grouping and
join mistakes
